{
  "id": "80849",
  "type": "Page",
  "tags": [],
  "title": "How to Use the OLI Course ",
  "content": {
    "bibrefs": [],
    "model": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "This course is thoughtfully designed (relying heavily on research-based principles of learning science) to guide you through your learning of "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "General Chemistry"
              },
              {
                "text": ". Understanding how and why the course is set-up as it is will help you better utilize all aspects of the course and allow you to more successfully and efficiently learn the concepts."
              }
            ],
            "id": "ksuzxqzcq5zteqf",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "oo409ylnqp9cq0q",
                "text": "Learning Objectives"
              }
            ],
            "id": "mbx76wkx6j23d4l",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "One of the first things you will notice as you begin is that at the top of every core content page there are one or more learning objectives."
              }
            ],
            "id": "qqu5b63s55y0j6l",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Learning Objectives appear at the top of the page to guide your learning."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "471dz2pyeo7q6c6",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "nlt72o2nrpvaqhb",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "sh8btbzi4r86r29",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/7b/7ba454df94bd5059a7c61f8cfc315355/LO_noWords.png",
                "type": "img",
                "width": "700"
              }
            ],
            "id": "m9lfql47ax44800",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "These learning objectives are intended to guide you as to what you should be accomplishing on that page(s). It is a good idea to make a mental note of, or even write down, these learning objectives and reflect on them as you are going through the content. Ask yourself, \"Am I achieving this objective?\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "d08wbk8l1hlcwn4",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "xv3xek3j9ochq8z",
                "text": "Activities"
              }
            ],
            "id": "bba5z2iwjzxycx6",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "There are"
              },
              {
                "strong": true,
                "text": " many "
              },
              {
                "text": "activities throughout this course. The activities are designed to more fully engage you in the learning process. You will notice there are two categories of activities within the modules: "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              },
              {
                "text": " and "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Did I Get This"
              },
              {
                "text": ". These types of activities are designed in different ways, each for a unique purpose. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "39aeizdkfvs78k0",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "2m1cruqx7aezek2",
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              }
            ],
            "id": "h0w08jfhsfjrdh4",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              },
              {
                "text": " activities are designed to scaffold your learning. They provide significantly more guidance than the "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Did I Get This"
              },
              {
                "text": " activities in a number of ways. One of the more obvious methods of guidance is hints. You will notice that many of these activities have hints. If you are unsure how to approach a problem, ask for a hint to guide you. Note that some problems have multiple hints."
              }
            ],
            "id": "7ai6wfen44ltwij",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Learn By Doing activities scaffold practice. Ask for a hint if you are unsure how to progress. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "5bpsulbeoc9yqx2",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "u1oztip01ooxh0d",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "eqj2s7lh4es0hpb",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/24/248a90b72bb98564d066dc4e47c770e0/learnByDoingNoWords.png",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "4uqi8ibnjivlt2w",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "An additional way you will see that "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              },
              {
                "text": " activities help to scaffold learning is to present problems in a step-by-step manner. "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              },
              {
                "text": " activities are usually presented before "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Did I Get This"
              },
              {
                "text": " activities."
              }
            ],
            "id": "brqy3hpo6g4mzak",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Some Learn By Doing activities present problem solving in a step-by-step manner to scaffold practice. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "h4lnb9t0ycw6kez",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "oxa6vqf9tycwvtt",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "belzdugof7ozlx0",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/ea/eafddfa5808c1a57e4311933898ee490/LearnByDoing2NoWords.png",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "mbfs5pduv9yslab",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "ofk0hlsy561uo2h",
                "text": "Did I Get This"
              }
            ],
            "id": "3s5zj0qpb4h63kz",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Did I Get This"
              },
              {
                "text": " activities are designed to be a self-assessment. Problems generally do not include hints and are generally not presented in a step-wise manner. This is your opportunity to determine after reading through the material and performing the numerous activities that preceded, whether or not you \"got\" the concept. In the event that you feel that you have not \"gotten\" the concept, it is a good idea to go back and review the previous material and/or seek help from your instructor. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "c64dvj5q4npozh1",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Did I get this activities allow you to self-assess your understanding before a graded assignment. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "fo25yytk49y8rwa",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "ls6skiowrh5kgsm",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "44zsnpawmcrhl3w",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/30/30f11fed884a4c0bde03ea1f72e72e5e/didIGetThisNoWords.png",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "tahp7zkp3zd1soj",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "bvlb7hgt7jsz7v6",
                "text": "Multi-Page Activities"
              }
            ],
            "id": "q67e8z9dojr9ncl",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Note that some of the activities ("
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              },
              {
                "text": " and "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Did I Get This"
              },
              {
                "text": ") have multiple pages of problems. Click the \"NEXT\" button below the activity to see subsequent pages. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "i5ige6cay8tr279",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "v8pj8pac7rk492c",
                "strong": true,
                "text": "Page 1 of Activity"
              }
            ],
            "id": "41nam4ku39oyhnt",
            "type": "h5"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "2zqmimd3ql277b3",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "jlsr7y7x4sc0wca",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/77/778e436607513d89dfa1f033607d90d5/multiple_acts_page1.png",
            "type": "img"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "s7ecm8jir6usvds",
                "strong": true,
                "text": "Page 2 of Activity"
              }
            ],
            "id": "oe7htiaste0o02u",
            "type": "h5"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "5tdswhhwa322h95",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "ymgblu705itzpzw",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/d5/d54a5140bb3c0203784c66f2ef5a94c6/multiple_acts_page2.png",
            "type": "img"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "lye38tblmudb70l",
                "text": "End of Module Activities"
              }
            ],
            "id": "u0p2wmo0zzlbbep",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "rt9fnrv7z394nhv",
                "text": "My Response"
              }
            ],
            "id": "x51ut23yyf3su9q",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "My Response"
              },
              {
                "text": " activity links are at the end of each module. These activities allow you to reflect on how well you learned the concepts presented. Reflecting on your own learning, also know as metacognition, is a proven way to promote the development of effective learning."
              }
            ],
            "id": "0c2os3ouijjfd8g",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": " You also have the opportunity to include questions you might have for your instructor. Your responses are sent to your instructor and may be used in classroom discussions."
              }
            ],
            "id": "aplew20eqx7udpl",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Click on the My Response link to reflect on your understanding and provide feedback to your instructor. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "do6etu0c5qw8bl9",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "pgurh5vbm46s8mi",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "dyl2rkagwvvsor3",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/77/77eb6a4720eeda13f098fbf2e8223c7d/myResponseNoWords.png",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "3tcir3rcr6tga69",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "elwxeial9hxofsm",
                "text": "Checkpoint"
              }
            ],
            "id": "7jau9zhy08grwjw",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "There is a "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Checkpoint"
              },
              {
                "text": " at the end of each module and unit. This is a graded assignment and the score will be reported to your instructor. Your instructor may decide to assign points to your overall grade in the course for these assignments."
              }
            ],
            "id": "2eemsp8qbx0x979",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "6o4dw3ovxbx4cl8",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "fmu97jq7ptp86g9",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/46/46fc019f6658d3a660d4382b66c32708/mole_checkpoint.png",
            "type": "img"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "r54x539robi2c3g",
                "text": "Entering Scientific Notation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "4329xtd4rsbi95x",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "___selfClosing___": true,
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "zjp7q4ct8b5dj9f",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "xc6j4rlgxyigvky",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "There are many numeric input problems within this course. For any of these you may use standard notation or scientific notation. It is highly recommended for very small or very large values that you use scientific notation."
              }
            ],
            "id": "wt7ttnato7x7ocw",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "For exponents, use the letter e. For example, for 6.022×10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "23"
              },
              {
                "text": " enter 6.022e23. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "ehglo1obn9yru7p",
            "type": "p"
          }
        ],
